{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Agriculture in Central Africa faces numerous challenges. Poor soil fertility, an unfavorable climate, and a lack of sufficient funding are just some of the obstacles you\u2019ll have to overcome in this region.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Farm Manager World \u2013 Africa DLC includes:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Central Africa region with a unique climate and demanding soil</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Campaign set in Africa</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 African scenarios, including 1 co-op scenario</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draft machines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pack animals such as oxen and donkeys</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New livestock: Watusi cattle, Cameroon sheep, Boer goat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 new crops: Taro, Yam, Okra, Sesame, Vanilla, Lemon</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slash-and-burn field creation method</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 treadmill buildings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sugar factory building</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 new logistics type</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 product types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New trainings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Regional trade partners</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Regional decorations</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4113390?t=1762339280","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113390/574b03050a8eddba70065ec2bcd9867b5f22b78a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762339280","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113390/3f87c28bd94e6bbd07e41185776ef0783817193e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762339280","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113390/3f87c